331	      // as the ProductScroller branch below already does — without it, this branch would render
332	      // inset inside the page's normal content padding while every sibling rail on the same page
333	      // bleeds edge-to-edge, and zimmRecentlyViewedRail.css.ts's own card-width math (e.g.
